ger occurs whenever data of a particular type is accessed.</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">data-access-ended<a name=\"trigger-type-data-access-ended\"> </a></td><td>Data Access Ended</td><td>The trigger occurs whenever access to data of a particular type is completed.</td></tr></table></div>"
