idenceVariable-exposure\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Evidence Variable in variable role Exposure</td>\n          \n          <td>Evidence Variable in variable role Exposure.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">EvidenceVariable-outcome\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-EvidenceVariable-outcome\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Evidence Variable in variable role Outcome (MeasuredVariable)</td>\n          \n          <td>Evidence Variable in variable role Outcome (MeasuredVariable).</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Efficacy-outcomes\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Efficacy-outcomes\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Efficacy-outcomes</td>\n          \n          <td>Outcomes related to efficacy or potential benefits of interventions.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Harms-outcomes\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Harms-outcomes\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Harms outcomes</td>\n          \n          <td>Outcomes related to adverse effects or potential harms of interventions.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">SampleSize\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-SampleSize\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Sample Size</td>\n          \n          <td>Sample Size.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">References\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-References\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>References</td>\n          \n          <td>References.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Assertion\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Assertion\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Assertion</td>\n          \n          <td>Assertion.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Reasons\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Reasons\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Reasons</td>\n          \n          <td>Reasons.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Certainty-of-Evidence\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Certainty-of-Evidence\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Certainty of Evidence</td>\n          \n          <td>Certainty of Evidence.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Evidence-Classifier\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Evidence-Classifier\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Evidence Classifier section</td>\n          \n          <td>This section is used for classifiers of the evidence.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Warnings\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Warnings\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Warnings</td>\n          \n          <td>Warnings.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Text-Summary\n            \n            <a name=\"evidence-report-section-Text-Summary\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Text Summary</td>\n          \