-          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n      \n      <h2>GuidePageGeneration</h2>\n      \n      <div>\n        \n        <p>A code that indicates how the page is generated.</p>\n\n      \n      </div>\n      \n      <p>This code system http://hl7.org/fhir/guide-page-generation defines the following codes:</p>\n      \n      <table class=\"codes\">\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n            \n            <b>Code</b>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>\n            \n            <b>Display</b>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>\n            \n            <b>Definition</b>\n          \n          </td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">html\n            \n            <a name=\"guide-page-generation-html\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>HTML</td>\n          \n          <td>Page is proper xhtml with no templating.  Will be brought across unchanged for standard post-processing.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">markdown\n            \n            <a name=\"guide-page-generation-markdown\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Markdown</td>\n          \n          <td>Page is markdown with templating.  Will use the template to create a file that imports the markdown file prior to post-processing.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">xml\n            \n            <a name=\"guide-page-generation-xml\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>XML</td>\n          \n          <td>Page is xml with templating.  Will use the template to create a file that imports the source file and run the nominated XSLT transform (see parameters) if present prior to post-processing.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">generated\n            \n            <a name=\"guide-page-generation-generated\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Generated</td>\n          \n          <td>Page will be generated by the publication process - no source to bring across.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n      \n      </table>\n    \n    </div>"
