-          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n      \n      <h2>StructureMapTargetListMode</h2>\n      \n      <div>\n        \n        <p>If field is a list, how to manage the production.</p>\n\n      \n      </div>\n      \n      <p>This code system http://hl7.org/fhir/map-target-list-mode defines the following codes:</p>\n      \n      <table class=\"codes\">\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n            \n            <b>Code</b>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>\n            \n            <b>Display</b>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>\n            \n            <b>Definition</b>\n          \n          </td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">first\n            \n            <a name=\"map-target-list-mode-first\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>First</td>\n          \n          <td>when the target list is being assembled, the items for this rule go first. If more than one rule defines a first item (for a given instance of mapping) then this is an error.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">share\n            \n            <a name=\"map-target-list-mode-share\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Share</td>\n          \n          <td>the target instance is shared with the target instances generated by another rule (up to the first common n items, then create new ones).</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">last\n            \n            <a name=\"map-target-list-mode-last\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Last</td>\n          \n          <td>when the target list is being assembled, the items for this rule go last. If more than one rule defines a last item (for a given instance of mapping) then this is an error.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">collate\n            \n            <a name=\"map-target-list-mode-collate\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Collate</td>\n          \n          <td>re-use the first item in the list, and keep adding content to it.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n      \n      </table>\n    \n    </div>"
