-          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n      \n      <h2>AdverseEventActuality</h2>\n      \n      <div>\n        \n        <p>Overall nature of the adverse event, e.g. real or potential.</p>\n\n      \n      </div>\n      \n      <p>This code system http://hl7.org/fhir/adverse-event-actuality defines the following codes:</p>\n      \n      <table class=\"codes\">\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n            \n            <b>Code</b>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>\n            \n            <b>Display</b>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>\n            \n            <b>Definition</b>\n          \n          </td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">actual\n            \n            <a name=\"adverse-event-actuality-actual\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Adverse Event</td>\n          \n          <td>The adverse event actually happened regardless of whether anyone was affected or harmed.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n        \n        <tr>\n          \n          <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">potential\n            \n            <a name=\"adverse-event-actuality-potential\"> </a>\n          \n          </td>\n          \n          <td>Potential Adverse Event</td>\n          \n          <td>A potential adverse event.</td>\n        \n        </tr>\n      \n      </table>\n    \n    </div>"
